Third-party content in the Eight Sleep Binding
==============================================

This binding is an original work. It communicates with the Eight Sleep cloud
API (client-api.8slp.net, app-api.8slp.net, auth-api.8slp.net) and contains no
third-party source code.

Runtime dependencies (provided by the openHAB runtime):
- com.google.code.gson:gson - Google Gson, Apache License 2.0
- org.slf4j:slf4j-api - MIT License
- org.eclipse.jdt:org.eclipse.jdt.annotation - Eclipse Public License 2.0
